{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spiritstead</strong> is a cozy life sim town building game where you care for a growing village full of cute little villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start by placing houses. As you build, new villagers will arrive along with new buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/Steam_Building_GIF-ezgif.com-added-text.gif?t=1752762524\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign them to farms, mills, or workshops to gather resources, earn gold, and keep your town running and growing. But be careful, if you overwork them, they will get tired and grumpy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__3_.gif?t=1752762524\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your villagers become grumpy, take care of them by sending them to caf\u00e9s, bookstores, or other happiness buildings. These places help them rest and feel happy again. Otherwise, they might leave the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/Steam_Work9-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1752762524\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you expand your village and unlock new levels, you will gain access to new buildings, cute items, and fun ways to decorate your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/NEw_level_steam.gif?t=1752762524\" /></div>Some say that if your town is just right, magical \u2728spirits\u2728 may appear to help your village or simply be fun to collect.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501540?t=1752762524","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501540?t=1752762524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/742ba711f44415793204adf8338d482a90d3af03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752762524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/742ba711f44415793204adf8338d482a90d3af03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752762524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spiritstead</strong> is a cozy life sim town building game where you care for a growing village full of cute little villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start by placing houses. As you build, new villagers will arrive along with new buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/Steam_Building_GIF-ezgif.com-added-text.gif?t=1752762524\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign them to farms, mills, or workshops to gather resources, earn gold, and keep your town running and growing. But be careful, if you overwork them, they will get tired and grumpy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__3_.gif?t=1752762524\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your villagers become grumpy, take care of them by sending them to caf\u00e9s, bookstores, or other happiness buildings. These places help them rest and feel happy again. Otherwise, they might leave the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/Steam_Work9-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1752762524\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you expand your village and unlock new levels, you will gain access to new buildings, cute items, and fun ways to decorate your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/NEw_level_steam.gif?t=1752762524\" /></div>Some say that if your town is just right, magical \u2728spirits\u2728 may appear to help your village or simply be fun to collect.</p>","developers":["Turbo Dog Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/43e16c71202e899d2ec9233b632904971557ee0d/header.jpg?t=1752762524","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257170287,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170287/movie480.mp4?t=1752762522","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170287/movie_max.mp4?t=1752762522"},"name":"Spiritstead Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257170287/2bfbbaeb61e1d68cdd0356a893f428355608cc69/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752762522","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170287/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752762522","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170287/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752762522"}}],"name":"Spiritstead","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics should be enough<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Turbo Dog Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/4433d995f21312dd79e6e5ef6d0e19c9ae875fdb/ss_4433d995f21312dd79e6e5ef6d0e19c9ae875fdb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752762524","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/4433d995f21312dd79e6e5ef6d0e19c9ae875fdb/ss_4433d995f21312dd79e6e5ef6d0e19c9ae875fdb.600x338.jpg?t=1752762524"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/91ac1d495ff7667468b078f02dbdd15f1094d40d/ss_91ac1d495ff7667468b078f02dbdd15f1094d40d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752762524","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/91ac1d495ff7667468b078f02dbdd15f1094d40d/ss_91ac1d495ff7667468b078f02dbdd15f1094d40d.600x338.jpg?t=1752762524"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/967b00c04567296836fe00292dfe86c4c54f04ee/ss_967b00c04567296836fe00292dfe86c4c54f04ee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752762524","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/967b00c04567296836fe00292dfe86c4c54f04ee/ss_967b00c04567296836fe00292dfe86c4c54f04ee.600x338.jpg?t=1752762524"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/44fe196c5fae0cf970e35a75d46f9cc122e879c5/ss_44fe196c5fae0cf970e35a75d46f9cc122e879c5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752762524","path_thumbnail":"https: